 ### Load-Time Marching Cubes Table Generation
-A technique to generate the Marching Cubes triangle table at load time rather than hardcoding it, ensuring consistency between the generator and the kernel [S14, unofficial]. It generates marching squares faces for each cube face, forms closed loops, triangulates them using fan triangulation, and applies an ambiguity rule that always separates the diagonal for ambiguous faces to ensure rotation invariance and crack-free results [S14, unofficial]. Choose it when maintaining table consistency across different execution environments (e.g., JS/WGSL) is critical.
